    "title": "Half-Assed RAG Implementation (Dec 15, 2025)",
    "description": "Production RAG system used simplified JSON+numpy storage instead of proper vector database (ChromaDB/LanceDB). Added Cohere Rerank to band-aid the broken system instead of fixing the underlying O(n) linear search. CEO correctly called it out as 'half-assed'.",
